        "title": "GREAT basketball for our rec league",
        "body": "This ball is so good, I keep buying this same model as we grow in sizes. It's too nice to use on pavement or outdoor courts. It has a very rich color tone. It feels substantial in the hands. You can sense the quality. The skin and seams give the ball a great grip. The weight and balance are perfect and the bounce was great right out of the box. This ball is so good, that the referees in our recreation league ask to use it as a game ball. My son's friends comment about what a nice ball it is. I'm extremely pleased with the quality and price. I have yet to wear one out. It's such a good ball, that we can give his friends identical balls for their birthdays and everyone will be happy.",
